The Java bridge in this directory links against Forge, which is licensed under
the GNU General Public License version 3 or later. It is therefore also
GPL-3.0-or-later, and not covered by the MIT license at the repository root.

The Python harness communicates with this bridge over a local socket as a
separate process. That separation is deliberate. Do not collapse it by
importing one into the other's build.

Forge itself is not distributed here. scripts/fetch-forge.sh downloads a pinned
release at install time.

Full GPL-3.0 text: https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt
